    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gaguursa Abramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Abramu, “Beawana ng'eanyiidaang'u ak giriteawi ghaheang'wa ea jeeda buweadeagaagu ea hita ng'eanyiida jea daahiimneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' huwa eemeeda haw, ak gaydagoonyi ghawooda, ak gaydanung' gwaheedu gheawungaagu, ak abeeda geegoonyi ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydaadaw ghawooda fuga goonyi ghawooda, nea siida mwaashtaneey gaydamwaashta; nea aba badaydaang'u gayghoadaw ghawooda eemoojiga sean bea muunda ng'eanyiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gawa Abramu, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA; hean goodeayi Lutu. Abeeda Abramu gaba gweanyeew laadam ea damanamuut damanda balaga Harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat Abramu gatmoadaanyi was Sara, ea Lutuheeda was orjeeda baleanda ghaamwat, ea haleanjeeda nyaawa sean mideawa, sea fuga nyasa hoowa bea Haraniin; hean gwasimsa beata gaweay ng'eanyiida Ganaani. Hita ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwasik Abramu jeeda ng'eanyiida ea ghwahita Shekemu mida sawacheanda More. Abeeda damandida gwanda ng'eanyiida eemeeda Ganaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabussa NG'UTAMIIDA Abramu ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eanyiini gaydagoonyi ea jeacheangaagu.” Ng'ata gwasissa NG'UTAMIIDA heeda wagiida aba hoowa, nea dea busiinyi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu goosiipta ea ghwahita heeda giijeeda mida gayeewda Beteli, ak ghamiinda maheemajeandaanyi aba dageascheeda Beteli aba heeda biyeara ea Ayi aba heeda ghayeawa; ak gwasissa NG'UTAMIIDA heeda wagiida ak ghabwat gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaneayeewa Abramu jeeda ng'eanyiida, nea gagal Negebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu aba ng'eanyiida Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghang'eat geejeeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. Hean ghang'eat Abramu gwararang'eesa ng'eanyiida Misri ak ghoah rabascheanda aba ng'eanyiita gili nuwaas aba gideaba ghwaraanya geejeeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyi bwak ama riikghta ghoaghaawa moonghooda Misri, gwayeesha Sarayiheeda was gatmoadaanyi, “Ghaanali gideaba guwoosi miyaasiin lean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi iidaanyi fuga Misri gaygwayi, ‘Nih gatmoadaanyi’; ak abeeda gaygwanuusan, ak ghwanung'waadaneey ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeshiina guwoosi hudiya, ak abeeda gayghwanung'waadanaan aba badaydaang'u, ak abeeda gayghaghu eaweegeasu aba badaydaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahita Abramu ng'eanyiida Misri ghwadaah fuga Misri gideaba gatmoodida aamiy muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah orjooga Farao gatmooni, ghaghwar aba madeeda Farao. Ak geayaat gatmooda gheeh Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba badaydeaba niny geesissa Abramu ng'asheega miyaas; ak geataw gisilga, ea heewga, ea jiirgwa digeeniga, ea fuga gadiyeeda was headiga, ea haweega gadiyeeda, ea gheamadiga digeeniga ea ngamiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalas NG'UTAMIIDA Farao ea gheanyi aba dawneeda haw aba badayda Sarayiheeda was gatmooda Abramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa Farao Abramu ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i nihindanaaniin? Ghwasaan anda mii rukunean gideaba nih gatmoadaang'u? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasaan anda giyeeni, ‘Nih huda geamadu gil’, ak geageandi ghoah gatmoodeanyu? Asi nukwa gatmoadaang'u, ak guwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghoadayda Farao iitaanyi; eahoana jeeda ng'eanyiida sea gatmoadaanyi ea buuneadaanyi ea haleanjeeda sean mideawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
